commands.command:
/usr/bin/zsh -lc "cat > index.html <<'EOF'
<"'!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#173f49">
  <meta name="description" content="A quiet study. An independent film practice.">
  <title>A quiet study. — An independent film practice.</title>
  <style>
    :root { color-scheme: dark light; --ink: #173f49; --paper: #f4efdf; }
    * { box-sizing: border-box; }
    body { margin: 0; background: var(--ink); color: var(--paper); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; }
    a { color: inherit; }
    a:focus-visible { outline: 3px solid #f1b85b; outline-offset: 7px; }
    .skip { position: absolute; z-index: 10; top: 16px; left: 24px; padding: 14px; background: var(--paper); color: var(--ink); transform: translateY(-180%); }
    .skip:focus { transform: none; }
    .hero { position: relative; min-height: 780px; min-height: max(780px, 100svh); isolation: isolate; overflow: hidden; background: var(--ink); }
    .poster { position: absolute; inset: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; object-position: 70% center; z-index: -2; }
    .hero::before { content: ""; position: absolute; inset: 0; background: linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(8, 30, 35, .63), rgba(8, 30, 35, .12) 75%), linear-gradient(0deg, rgba(8, 30, 35, .75), transparent 36%); z-index: -1; pointer-events: none; }
    .masthead { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin: 0 5vw; padding: 30px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(244, 239, 223, .35); }
    .monogram { font-family: Georgia, '"'Times New Roman', serif; font-size: 28px; letter-spacing: -.09em; padding-right: .09em; }
    .nav-link { font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: .08em; text-decoration: none; padding: 12px 0; }
    .nav-link span { margin-left: 24px; }
    .hero-content { padding: clamp(85px, 12vh, 160px) 5vw 150px; max-width: 1500px; margin-inline: auto; }
    h1 { font-family: Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif; font-weight: 400; font-size: clamp(86px, 11.8vw, 180px); line-height: .93; letter-spacing: -.065em; margin: 0 0 35px -.055em; max-width: 10ch; text-wrap: balance; }
    h1 span { display: block; }
    .intro { margin: 0; font-size: clamp(16px, 1.4vw, 20px); line-height: 1.5; }
    .explore { display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start; width: 124px; height: 124px; padding: 17px; margin-top: 38px; border: 1px solid var(--paper); border-radius: 0; text-decoration: none; font-size: 14px; background: rgba(8, 30, 35, .25); }
    .explore .arrow { align-self: flex-end; font-size: 27px; line-height: 1; }
    .explore:hover { background: var(--paper); color: var(--ink); }
    .hero-foot { position: absolute; bottom: 28px; left: 5vw; right: 5vw; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-end; gap: 24px; border-top: 1px solid rgba(244, 239, 223, .35); padding-top: 18px; font-size: 11px; line-height: 1.6; letter-spacing: .025em; }
    .media-note { max-width: 320px; margin: 0; }
    .still-label { white-space: nowrap; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .16em; }
    .still-label::before { content: \"\"; display: inline-block; width: 6px; height: 6px; margin-right: 9px; background: #f1b85b; vertical-align: 1px; }
    .work { padding: 90px 5vw 70px; background: var(--paper); color: var(--ink); scroll-margin-top: 24px; }
    .work-heading { display: flex; align-items: baseline; justify-content: space-between; gap: 20px; margin-bottom: 36px; padding-bottom: 25px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(23, 63, 73, .35); }
    h2 { font-family: Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif; font-weight: 400; font-size: clamp(42px, 5vw, 72px); line-height: 1.1; letter-spacing: -.045em; margin: 0; }
    .work-heading span { font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .12em; }
    figure { margin: 0; }
    .work img { width: 100%; height: auto; display: block; background: var(--ink); }
    figcaption { padding-top: 17px; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.5; }
    @media (min-width: 1600px) { .hero-content { max-width: none; } }
    @media (max-width: 600px) {
      .hero { min-height: 850px; min-height: max(850px, 100svh); }
      .masthead { margin-inline: 24px; padding-block: 21px; }
      .hero-content { padding: 110px 24px 160px; }
      h1 { font-size: clamp(76px, 18vw, 108px); margin-bottom: 30px; }
      .hero::before { background: linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(8, 30, 35, .78), rgba(8, 30, 35, .36)), linear-gradient(0deg, rgba(8, 30, 35, .8), transparent 40%); }
      .hero-foot { left: 24px; right: 24px; flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; gap: 9px; }
      .work { padding: 60px 24px 40px; }
      .work-heading { align-items: flex-start; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px; margin-bottom: 24px; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <a class=\"skip\" href=\"#main\">Skip to content</a>
  <main id=\"main\">
    <section class=\"hero\" aria-labelledby=\"hero-title\">
      <img class=\"poster\" src=\"assets/poster.svg\" width=\"960\" height=\"540\" alt=\"\" fetchpriority=\"high\">
      <header class=\"masthead\">
        <span class=\"monogram\" aria-label=\"A quiet study\">aqs.</span>
        <nav aria-label=\"Main\"><a class=\"nav-link\" href=\"#work\">Selected work <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a></nav>
      </header>
      <div class=\"hero-content\">
        <h1 id=\"hero-title\">A quiet <span>study.</span></h1>
        <p class=\"intro\">An independent film practice.</p>
        <a class=\"explore\" href=\"#work\">Explore<span class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↘</span></a>
      </div>
      <div class=\"hero-foot\">
        <span class=\"still-label\">Static preview</span>
        <p class=\"media-note\">Poster shown. Film footage has not been supplied; video playback is unverified.</p>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class=\"work\" id=\"work\" aria-labelledby=\"work-title\">
      <div class=\"work-heading\"><h2 id=\"work-title\">Selected work</h2><span>Poster study</span></div>
      <figure>
        <img src=\"assets/poster.svg\" width=\"960\" height=\"540\" alt=\"A golden circle above a curved sage landscape against a deep teal field.\" loading=\"lazy\">
        <figcaption>Locally authored geometric poster.</figcaption>
      </figure>
    </section>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
EOF
cat > NOTES.md <<'EOF'
# Authoring notes
- Built "'`index.html` with the supplied copy, square Explore anchor, and #work destination. No dependencies or JavaScript.
- Selected R4 framing/text protection for the static poster: cover, 70% center focal point, teal scrim; stronger scrim below 600px. Hero minimum 780px desktop / 850px mobile, fluid serif heading, 124px square CTA. No motion; reduced-motion and disabled-JS views use the same static page.
- `assets/poster.svg` is a verified local fixture; rights are recorded in `assets/rights.json`. `scene.webm` is listed in that record but absent from this workspace. No video source was invented or added. The page states the footage/playback limitation.
- Shell content checks only. Browser/runtime behavior, visual quality, responsive framing, keyboard operation, and playback remain unverified; the central observer owns qualification. No browser, server, installs, external services, or second verification workflow used.
EOF
# Small content check only; no runtime or browser qualification.
test -s index.html && test -s assets/poster.svg && test -s NOTES.md && test ! -e assets/scene.webm && rg -n '"'hero-title|An independent film practice\\.|class=\"explore\" href=\"#work\"|id=\"work\"|video playback is unverified' index.html"
